    "title": "Hops lose home opener, but new stadium is a hit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Wade Evanson ,\n11 hours ago The Hops’ 2026 home opener was more than just a baseball game; it was an event due to the shiny new building it was being played in. As a result, it wasn’t good enough to show up an hour or even two prior to the action, for people lined the steps to the new stadium more than two hours before the game to get their first taste of Hillsboro’s newest attraction. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
